                <opener><seg rendition="#center">No. 1.</seg></opener>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract.]</seg></opener>
                <head>Consul Moore to Earl Russell.—(Received June 28.)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Richmond,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1863-06-09"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >June</hi> 9, 1863.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p>I have the honor to enclose herewith the copy of a despatch and enclosures
                    written by me to Lord Lyons, dated the 6th instant, from which your lordship
                    will gather that this government has annulled my exequatur.</p>

                <postscript>
                    <p>P. S.—I also enclose copy of my answer to Mr. Benjamin.</p>
                </postscript>




